1: Yes, you can get a refund for a duplicate charge. Atlas detects most duplicate charges within
24 hours and refunds them automatically, or Support will refund the duplicate as soon as it is
reported. Refunds appear on card statements within 5 to 10 business days, while refunds of direct
debits take up to 3 business days.

Sources: Article KB-201, Atlas Billing 5.2 User Guide, part 6.
2: Ticket 15 ("Duplicate charge on credit card") is currently marked as Resolved. It had a
priority level of High and was created on May 16, 2026.

